#: src/build-system-reference.md:181
msgid "`make scr.recipe` - A shortcut for `make sc.recipe r.recipe`"
msgstr ""

#: src/build-system-reference.md:182
msgid "`make scrp.recipe` - A shortcut for `make sc.recipe rp.recipe`"
msgstr ""

#: src/build-system-reference.md:183
msgid ""
"`make lc.recipe` - Set the recipe rule to `local`, which dies the following "
"things:"
msgstr ""

#: src/build-system-reference.md:185
msgid ""
"Disable automatic remote Git repository fetch to prevent the breakage of "
"local changes and clean existing recipe binaries"
