#: src/build-system-reference.md:186
msgid "Automatically download sources if they don't exist"
msgstr ""

#: src/build-system-reference.md:187
msgid ""
"Enable source compilation with pre-built dependencies when when "
"`REPO_BINARY` is enabled"
msgstr ""

#: src/build-system-reference.md:189
msgid "`make lcrp.recipe` - A shortcut for `make lc.recipe rp.recipe`"
msgstr ""

#: src/build-system-reference.md:190
msgid ""
"`make nc.recipe` - Set the recipe rule to `ignore` (disable installation on "
