msgstr ""

#: src/build-system-reference.md:191
msgid ""
"`make cc.recipe` - Reset recipe rule to default (`source`) and clean "
"existing recipe binaries"
msgstr ""

#: src/build-system-reference.md:192
msgid ""
"`make c.recipe` (abbreviation of `clean`) - Clean one or multiple recipe "
