#: src/build-system-reference.md:193
msgid "`make cr.recipe` - A shortcut for `make c.recipe r.recipe`"
msgstr ""

#: src/build-system-reference.md:194
msgid "`make crp.recipe` - A shortcut for `make c.recipe r.recipe p.recipe`"
msgstr ""

#: src/build-system-reference.md:195
msgid "`make cri.recipe` - A shortcut for `make c.recipe r.recipe i.recipe`"
msgstr ""

#: src/build-system-reference.md:196
msgid ""
"`make u.recipe` (abbreviation of `unfetch`) - Clean one or multiple recipe "
"source code and binaries, while preserving packages (**please backup or "
"submit your source changes before the execution of this command**)."
msgstr ""

#: src/build-system-reference.md:197
msgid "`make uc.recipe` - A shortcut for `make u.recipe c.recipe`"
