msgstr ""

#: src/build-system-reference.md:203
msgid ""
"`make pt.recipe` (abbreviation of `push-tree`) - Show the package "
"dependencies that will be pushed into the Redox image"
msgstr ""

#: src/build-system-reference.md:204
msgid ""
"`make ur.recipe` - A shortcut for `make u.recipe r.recipe` (**please backup "
"or submit your source changes before the execution of this command**)."
msgstr ""

#: src/build-system-reference.md:205
msgid "`make rp.recipe` - A shortcut for `make r.recipe p.recipe`"
msgstr ""

#: src/build-system-reference.md:206
msgid ""
"`make x.--all` - Any recipe target (x) can be run in all previously used "
"recipes (remembered at `cookbook.lock`)"
msgstr ""

#: src/build-system-reference.md:207
msgid ""
"`make f.--all-binaries` - Update all previously downloaded pre-built "
"packages when `REPO_BINARY` is enabled"
msgstr ""

#: src/build-system-reference.md:208
msgid ""
"`make u.--all` - Remove all previously downloaded source and built binaries, "
"when `REPO_BINARY` is enabled it only clean downloaded sources and preserve "
"pre-built packages"
msgstr ""

